# Implements: backends/modal-any-model, tooling/key-setup, backends/modal
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in; lab reads .env from the folder it runs in.
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys and set a credit limit on it there.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Only for an open model on Modal: the token in its Modal secret (README, "Running on Modal").
MODAL_VLLM_KEY=
# The Modal addresses (each ending /v1) of the apps you deployed, for modal-mistral and modal-gemma.
MODAL_VLLM_BASE=
MODAL_GEMMA_BASE=
